                            <comment id="16830413" author="ivan.glukos" created="Tue, 30 Apr 2019 15:36:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slava.koptilin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slava.koptilin&quot;&gt;slava.koptilin&lt;/a&gt;, changes look good. Let&apos;s just add reproducer test to cover this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16830562" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 30 Apr 2019 18:32:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=slava.koptilin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;slava.koptilin&quot;&gt;slava.koptilin&lt;/a&gt; LGTM provided that we can add a unit test for it. As a summary from the private discussion, I also +1 for changing lastArchivedSegmentIdx to be currently started segment (now it is current finished) for &apos;no-archiver&apos; mode if it is needed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
